msgstr "Vous avez utilisé 80 % de votre limite d’utilisation de {cap} crédits dans le workspace Dust {workspaceName}."

#: front/lib/notifications/workflows/user-awu-cap-reached.ts
msgid "Once you reach 100%, you won't be able to run agents until your limit is increased. Please contact your workspace admin."
